  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogData
  sentences:
  - "Hello, welcome to the wood.\nYou finally opened your eyes\u2026"
  - 'This forest has been waiting for you.

    The wind whispers your name, even
    if you do not remember it.'
  - "Do not be afraid of the darkness.\nIt is not your enemy\u2026 not yet."
  - 'Move forward, little one.

    With every step, you will remember who you truly
    are.'
  - "And when you fall\u2026\nI will be here to guide you again."
  - Find the BlackSmith and check your Skill tree
